      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Asphalt shingles cost $10,000 to $18,000 and last 20 to 30 years, while metal roofs cost $20,000 to $40,000+ and last 40 to 70 years. Metal excels at shedding heavy mountain snow and resisting intense UV rays, whereas asphalt offers lower upfront costs and easier local repairs.",
